[{"text":"FromGFAD[exp] converts all suitable generic propagator denominators into standard and Cartesian propagator denominators.","anchor":"fromgfad"},{"text":"The options InitialSubstitutions and IntermediateSubstitutions can be used to help the function handle nontrivial propagators. In particular, InitialSubstitutions can define rules for completing the square in the loop momenta of the propagator, while IntermediateSubstitutions contains relations for scalar products appearing in those rules.","anchor":"fromgfad"},{"text":"Another useful option is LoopMomenta which is particularly helpful when converting mixed quadratic-eikonal propagators to quadratic ones.","anchor":"fromgfad"},{"text":"For propagators containing symbolic variables it might be necessary to tell the function that those are larger than zero (if applicable), so that expressions such as \\sqrt{\\lambda^2} can be simplified accordingly. To that aim one should use the option PowerExpand.","anchor":"fromgfad"},{"text":"Overview, GFAD, SFAD, CFAD, FeynAmpDenominatorExplicit.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"GFAD[SPD[p1]] ex = FromGFAD[%]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{GFAD}(\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1}))","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FromGFAD}(\\text{GFAD}(\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1})))","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*FromGFAD[GFAD[SPD[p1]]]*)","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex = GFAD[SPD[p1] + 2 SPD[p1, p2]]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{GFAD}(2 \\;\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1},\\text{p2})+\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1}))\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromGFAD[ex]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FromGFAD}(\\text{GFAD}(2 \\;\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1},\\text{p2})+\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1})))\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"We can get a proper conversion into a quadratic propagator using the option LoopMomenta. Notice that here p2.p2 is being put into the mass slot","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromGFAD[ex, LoopMomenta -> {p1}]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FromGFAD}(\\text{GFAD}(2 \\;\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1},\\text{p2})+\\text{SPD}(\\text{p1})),\\text{LoopMomenta}\\to \\{\\text{p1}\\})\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*GFAD[SPD[p1] + 2 SPD[p1, p2]]*)","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GFAD[{{CSPD[p1] + 2 CSPD[p1, p2] + m^2, -1}, 2}] ex = FromGFAD[%]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{GFAD}\\left(\\left\\{\\left\\{2 \\;\\text{CSPD}(\\text{p1},\\text{p2})+\\text{CSPD}(\\text{p1})+m^2,-1\\right\\},2\\right\\}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb7-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FromGFAD}\\left(\\text{GFAD}\\left(\\left\\{\\left\\{2 \\;\\text{CSPD}(\\text{p1},\\text{p2})+\\text{CSPD}(\\text{p1})+m^2,-1\\right\\},2\\right\\}\\right)\\right)","anchor":"cb7-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*FromGFAD[GFAD[{{m^2 + CSPD[p1] + 2 CSPD[p1, p2], -1}, 2}]]*)","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"DataType[la, FCVariable] = True; prop = FeynAmpDenominator[GenericPropagatorDenominator[-la Pair[Momentum[p1, D], Momentum[p1, D]] + 2 Pair[Momentum[p1, D], Momentum[q, D]], {1,1}]]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FeynAmpDenominator}(\\text{GenericPropagatorDenominator}(2 \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(q,D))-\\text{la} \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D)),\\{1,1\\}))","anchor":"cb9-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex = FromGFAD[prop]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FromGFAD}(\\text{FeynAmpDenominator}(\\text{GenericPropagatorDenominator}(2 \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(q,D))-\\text{la} \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D)),\\{1,1\\})))","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex = FromGFAD[prop, LoopMomenta -> {p1}]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FromGFAD}(\\text{FeynAmpDenominator}(\\text{GenericPropagatorDenominator}(2 \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(q,D))-\\text{la} \\;\\text{Pair}(\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D),\\text{Momentum}(\\text{p1},D)),\\{1,1\\})),\\text{LoopMomenta}\\to \\{\\text{p1}\\})","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex = GFAD[{{-SPD[p1, p1], 1}, 1}]*GFAD[{{SPD[p1, -p1 + 2*p3] - SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]* GFAD[{{-SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]*SFAD[{{I*(p1 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}]* SFAD[{{I*(p3 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}] + (-2*mg^2*GFAD[{{-SPD[p1, p1], 1}, 2}]* GFAD[{{SPD[p1, -p1 + 2*p3] - SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]*GFAD[{{-SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]* SFAD[{{I*(p1 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}]*SFAD[{{I*(p3 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}] - 2*mg^2*GFAD[{{-SPD[p1, p1], 1}, 1}]*GFAD[{{SPD[p1, -p1 + 2*p3] - SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 2}]*GFAD[{{-SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]*SFAD[{{I*(p1 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}]* SFAD[{{I*(p3 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}] - 2*mg^2*GFAD[{{-SPD[p1, p1], 1}, 1}]*GFAD[{{SPD[p1, -p1 + 2*p3] - SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 1}]*GFAD[{{-SPD[p3, p3], 1}, 2}]*SFAD[{{I*(p1 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}]*SFAD[{{I*(p3 + q), 0}, {-mb^2, 1}, 1}])/2","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Notice that FromGFAD does not expand scalar products in the propagators before trying to convert them to SFADs or CFADs. If this is needed, the user should better apply ExpandScalarProduct to the expression by hand.","anchor":"cb12-11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromGFAD[ex]","anchor":"cb13","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromGFAD[ExpandScalarProduct[ex]]","anchor":"cb14","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Using the option InitialSubstitutions one can perform certain replacement that might not be found automatically. The values of scalar products can be set using IntermediateSubstitutions","anchor":"cb14-1","section":"Examples"}]